Processing necessary to provide Officer Shica functionality requested by the user.

Legitimate interests — Article 6(1)(f) GDPR

Processing reasonably necessary for operating, securing, debugging, maintaining, and preventing abuse of Officer Shica, provided those interests are not overridden by users' fundamental rights and freedoms.

Legal obligations — Article 6(1)(c) GDPR

Processing required to comply with applicable legal obligations.

Where processing is based specifically on consent, consent may be withdrawn in accordance with applicable law.

